lete-ws2044621","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","quote":"　　竟陵張欣時爲諸暨令，坐罪當死。欣時父興世宋世討南譙王義宣，官軍欲殺融父暢，興世以袍覆暢而坐之，以此得免。興世卒，融著高履負土成墳。至是融啓竟陵王子良，乞代欣時死。子良答曰：「此乃是長史美事，恐朝有常典，不得如長史所懷。」遷黃門郎，太子中庶子，司徒左長史。融有孝義，忌月三旬不聽樂，事嫂甚謹。宋丞相義宣起事，父暢以不同將見殺，司馬竺超民諫免之。暢臨終謂諸子曰：「昔丞相事難，吾緣竺司馬得活，爾等必報其子弟。」後超民孫微冬月遭母喪，居貧，融往弔之，悉脫衣以爲賻，披牛被而反。常以兄事微。豫章王嶷、竟陵王子良薨，自以身經佐吏，哭輙盡慟。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0004","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0020"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"張興世以袍覆張暢，後張融請代欣時。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"張欣時","kind":"person","person_id":"orv_pqg_sww","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"欣時","kind":"person","person_id":"orv_pqg_sww","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025:m0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"欣時","kind":"person","person_id":"orv_pqg_sww","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete:p025","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-qi041-zhangxinshi-father","subject_person_id":"orv_pqg_sww","object_person_id":"ykp_uqh_6be_A","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"欣時父興世","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-041","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-041-zhangrong-complete-ws2044621","p